  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Appeal - Ukraine and Neighbouring Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 24 February 2022, the Russian Federation launched a broad military offensive against Ukraine. The situation in the country quickly deteriorated, with major attacks being reported across Ukraine, including in the capital, Kyiv. The overall unpredictability of the situation requires humanitarian actors to respond to the needs of the most vulnerable displaced and other conflict-affected communities. Through this project, IOM aims at providing multi-sectoral assistance in those countries affected by the ongoing humanitarian situation.</narrative>
  </description>
